    title: "ENISA 強化協調式漏洞揭露機制：支援歐盟 CSIRTs 網絡與新法規整合",
    summary: "本文闡述了協調式漏洞揭露（CVD）在保護數位世界免受數據竊取或關鍵系統中斷的關鍵作用。CVD 要求漏洞在公開前，必須由相關方（如研究人員、協調者、ICT 供應商和廠商）開發出修補程式或緩解措施。ENISA 作為歐盟 CSIRTs 網絡的秘書處，積極推動 CVD，特別是針對可能影響多個成員國的漏洞。隨著《網路安全法案》、《NIS2 指令》和《網路韌性法案》（CRA）的實施，CVD 的重要性日益提升。NIS2 指令特別要求 CSIRTs 參與國家層面的漏洞協調流程，並委託 ENISA 建立歐洲漏洞資料庫，供組織自願註冊和揭露產品漏洞。此外，ENISA 自 2024 年 1 月成為 CVE 編號機構（CNA），為歐盟 CSIRTs 建立漏洞登記服務，進一步強化了整個生態系統的協調能力。",
    tags: ["ENISA", "CVD", "CSIRTs", "NIS2 指令", "網路韌性法案", "CVE"],
    title_en: "ENISA Strengthens Coordinated Vulnerability Disclosure Mechanism: Supporting EU CSIRTs Network and New Regulation Integration",
    summary_en: "This article elaborates on the critical role of Coordinated Vulnerability Disclosure (CVD) in protecting the digital world from data theft or critical system disruptions. CVD requires that vulnerabilities must have patches or mitigation measures developed by relevant parties (such as researchers, coordinators, ICT suppliers, and vendors) before public disclosure. ENISA, as the secretariat for the EU CSIRTs Network, is actively promoting CVD, especially for vulnerabilities that may affect multiple member states. With the implementation of the Cybersecurity Act, NIS2 Directive, and the Cyber Resilience Act (CRA), the importance of CVD is increasing. The NIS2 Directive specifically mandates CSIRTs participation in national-level vulnerability coordination processes and tasks ENISA with establishing a European vulnerability database for organizations to voluntarily register and disclose product vulnerabilities. Furthermore, since January 2024, ENISA has become a CVE Numbering Authority (CNA), establishing a vulnerability registration service for EU CSIRTs, thereby further strengthening the coordination capacity of the entire ecosystem.",
